---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for AI Career Guide.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Terms of Use</h1>
    
    <div class="mt-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none 
  text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] 
  prose-headings:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] 
  prose-a:text-[var(--color-accent)] prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline 
  prose-strong:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] 
  prose-ul:text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] prose-ol:text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] marker:text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 15, 2026</p>

      <p>
        Welcome to AI Career Guide. By using our website, you agree to the following terms.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Content Ownership</h2>
      <p>
        All articles, guides, images, and other content on this site are owned by AI Career Guide unless otherwise stated. You may share excerpts with proper attribution, but you may not reproduce entire articles without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>
        We strive to provide accurate and up‑to‑date information, but we cannot guarantee that everything is error‑free. The content is for informational purposes only and does not constitute professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. We may earn a small commission if you make a purchase through them – at no extra cost to you. We only promote products we genuinely recommend.
      </p>

      <h2>4. User Conduct</h2>
      <p>
        When engaging with our website (e.g., leaving comments), you agree to be respectful and not to post spam, abusive, or harmful content.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        AI Career Guide is provided &#34;as is&#34;. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about these terms, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
